a string of cases where AI has outpaced humans in solving famous maths problems.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Man convicted of arson over deadly 2025 Palisades fire in Los Angeles</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5be0bb01636f728cd0610d0d0ca1dbbb27c561ab5312f0c10978e1a0f6fb390b</id><updated>2026-11-22T16:27:28Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T07:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/man-convicted-of-arson-over-deadly-2025-palisades-fire-in-los-angeles/a-80007933--9f183d2c9cc1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/man-convicted-of-arson-over-deadly-2025-palisades-fire-in-los-angeles/a-80007933?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A 30-year-old man has been convicted of causing one of the most destructive wildfires in the history of Los Angeles. The verdict came after the case was retried.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Brazil ex-President Jair Bolsonaro taken to hospital over abdominal pain</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0d8e6616ecfe4c6cbf117f4826f9d563acc652e946c65ccc89181ed36d5ff5a1</id><updated>2026-11-22T16:27:28Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T03:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brazil-ex-president-jair-bolsonaro-taken-to-hospital-over-abdominal-pain/a-80007648--e735cc923d74.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brazil-ex-president-jair-bolsonaro-taken-to-hospital-over-abdominal-pain/a-80007648?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Jair Bolsonaro has been hospitalized in Brasilia with intestinal obstruction. The former far-right Brazilian leader is receiving pain medications, his son Carlos said.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Russian ornithologist jailed over small donations to Navalny's foundation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5f0ecf869643130d77bd6916501223c9a9bf9865a599577ba98a1541c7796e7e</id><updated>2026-11-22T16:27:28Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T20:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russian-ornithologist-jailed-over-small-donations-to-navalny-s-foundation/a-80005505--49dba4e1f94e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russian-ornithologist-jailed-over-small-donations-to-navalny-s-foundation/a-80005505?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Sofia Rosenfeld has devoted her life to studying Arctic birds. A Russian court sentenced her to 3.5 years in a penal colony over donations to Navalny's foundation. Friends and family are fighting for her release.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Repression against Iranian lawyers increases</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d16f0d68132097d8b5891bed0bfe0af563be74c075bb3a9c08e9180dcbdaa901</id><updated>2026-11-22T16:27:28Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T20:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/repression-against-iranian-lawyers-increases/a-80006742--c2e9244e707c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/repression-against-iranian-lawyers-increases/a-80006742?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">At least 135 lawyers in Iran have been subjected to repressive measures over the past year. UN experts warn that this seriously jeopardizes the right of those accused to trial in a constitutional court.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
